  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have increased olfactory abilities in your human form.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Long-Nose Form<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When in your long-nosed human form, you gain a bonus equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) on all Perception checks and on Survival checks to track by smell. You can spend one use of mythic power as a move action to temporarily heighten your olfactory senses to preternatural levels, granting blindsense in a 10-foot radius for 1 round per mythic tier you possess. Creatures with overpowering scents, such as skunks or troglodytes, can be detected by your blindsense up to 30 feet away.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc73\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
